    "description": "The Utility Billing Reminders API offers clients the ability to retrieve a comprehensive list of reminders associated with utility billing. It serves as a tool for utilities and service providers to keep customers informed about their billing timelines, due dates, and payment alerts. The primary resources managed through this API include reminder records that facilitate improved customer communication and engagement. Typical consumers of this API include utility companies and third-party billing management systems aiming to enhance user experience and reduce missed payments.",
